## Context
host: {{.Hostname}}
user: {{.Username}}
shell: {{.Shell}}
window: {{.Window}}
session: {{.SessionID}}
{{- if .Repos}}
repositories:
{{- range .Repos}}
- {{.}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
working directories (in order): {{join .CWDs ", "}}
{{- if .Note}}

## Note from the user
{{.Note}}
{{- end}}

## Commands
Format: [seq] time exit=code duration cwd command
